```catala
declaration identity content anything of type a
  depends on x content anything of type a
  equals x

declaration foo content integer
  equals
  let y equals identity of 12 in
  1
```


```catala
declaration em content (list of money,
                        integer)
  depends on a content integer
  equals []

declaration foo1 content list of money
  equals
  let a equals em of 1 in []
```
